{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0088d250d000b74e5b3b4420b1c210331a70507e9fbd604a8f84dc8e9901d1d2",
      "text": "正因是我们，才做得到的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dc883762d03e93eaa3a0d3efa7a76487e1d4a5d4e5e17684091f85ead7707a",
      "text": "收到清凉饮料水广告邀约，干劲十足的\nJupiter。配合“为恋爱加油打气的饮品”\n这一主题，3人分别扮演各自的\n设定角色。广告带来的良好反响，\n甚至还拓展出了其他的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0088d250d000b74e5b3b4420b1c210331a70507e9fbd604a8f84dc8e9901d1d2",
      "text": "正因是我们，才做得到的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1988ecb16799445adfd4562fd462e5ca555094b5cddebd81e688971e8e9520",
      "text": "Ciao☆ ●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733dffc44f39b622e8dff33a00efb1a620baefb4cb539e9d55d8b5043921e543",
      "text": "各位辛苦了！\n今天的碰头开会，就请多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc94864901670ce74daac13855d47b6faf132e194b5c58d7434e6606a8b27a0b",
      "text": "嗯！……啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n我可以喝这瓶饮料吗？我口渴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "嗯，可以的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e17403adbe5be4fc529134dcf925e7bd16125506f38d4cec89c3c0423d7cb38",
      "text": "太好啦，那我就开动啦♪\n……哈啊。真好喝啊，这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:800218a758e20ebe9915bc1525881521cfe13b06d6e92bdcc5c267954c8a58b8",
      "text": "太好了！其实这次，我们收到了这款\n清凉饮料水的广告拍摄邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d039ed41db782260fb5982a42819f1dc2cb0ec1fdf760cdaf4192fd9083d920",
      "text": "嘿，广告的邀约啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f9b1103084831323aa5a5eb30e293e87d6f3d9ecdc098a1617e730ce1df2579",
      "text": "是的。听说广告的主题是\n“为恋爱加油打气的饮品”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71849493a930a582af8eb0333913eb56739105c0190cae38479b3776e64b494d",
      "text": "对方希望各位能扮演为受恋爱困扰的年轻人\n温柔提供建议的恋爱顾问角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b3a8913359f4e9d086513d5f70c8c289e93b4ed6c90223465cd7540ee5e70d",
      "text": "哎。很棒的主题呢。\n那种事情是我的拿手好戏哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2622ce2b383ce122c74014bf50718e0e50c5b7528d98b42a7c7253d997dc996",
      "text": "我们在工作上也积累了各种各样的经验嘛！\n这份邀约，务必让我们接下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70822dbcc1ce3a03401044c41d4bd51f4db941908165afdf199ac1974ff3e902",
      "text": "冬马君暂且不提，\n有比你们两个更受欢迎的我在，绝对能成功的呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
